        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A resolution or refresh rate change is applied as a trial and only for this app; if it is not confirmed within 15 seconds, or Sistem quits, the old mode returns. Dimming and night tone are also released by the system when the app ends (even if it crashes)."
